\f0\fs20 CloudMeet with OpenVPN Community\par
This installer installs CloudMeet and its private headless OpenVPN runtime with the signed Wintun adapter component. It does not install OpenVPN GUI or create OpenVPN shortcuts. Administrator permission is required for setup and driver deployment.\par
OpenVPN Community is third-party open-source software licensed under GPL and applicable dependency licenses. Its license notices remain in the vendor installation. Source and license information: https://github.com/OpenVPN/openvpn and https://openvpn.net/community/ .\par
The private CloudMeet VPN service and runtime are removed when uninstalling this bundle. Other applications' OpenVPN installations and shared drivers are not removed.\par
VPN routing is system-wide by destination IP, not exclusive to CloudMeet. CloudMeet does not provide a kill switch when disconnected.\par
By continuing you authorize installation of these components.\par
